38.213" end="38.440">来</span><span begin="38.440" end="38.836">争</span><span begin="38.836" end="39.221">取</span></p><p begin="39.231" end="43.794" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.231" end="40.171">要导人向</span><span begin="40.171" end="40.606">善</span> <span begin="40.606" end="40.891">常</span><span begin="40.891" end="41.689">要犯</span><span begin="41.689" end="42.019">弥</span><span begin="42.019" end="42.895">天的</span><span begin="42.895" end="43.794">罪</span></p></div><div begin="44.363" end="59.591" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="44.363" end="47.782" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.363" end="44.777">留</span><span begin="44.777" end="46.114">言擂台</span> <span begin="46.114" end="46.542">你</span><span begin="46.542" end="47.017">看</span><span begin="47.017" end="47.359">下</span><span begin="47.359" end="47.782">去</span></p><p begin="47.862" end="52.363" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.862" end="48.229">每</span><span begin="48.229" end="48.823">个</span><span begin="48.823" end="49.113">毒</span><span begin="49.113" end="49.501">舌</span> <span begin="49.635" end="50.074">都</span><span begin="50.074" end="50.680">隐</span><span begin="50.680" end="51.551">姓戴</span><span begin="51.551" end="51.863">面</span><span begin="51.863" end="52.363">具</span></p><p begin="53.432" end="59.591" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.432" end="53.779">就</span><span begin="53.779" end="54.217">算</span><span begin="54.217" end="54.495">侠</span><span begin="54.495" end="54.922">客</span> <span begin="55.009" end="55.394">亦</span><span begin="55.394" end="56.038">像</span><span begin="56.038" end="56.704">个恶</span><span begin="56.704" end="57.319">魔</span> <span begin="57.363" end="57.846">一</span><span begin="57.846" end="58.170">秒</span><span begin="58.170" end="58.927">下重</span><span begin="58.927" end="59.591">锤</span></p></div><div begin="59.601" end="1:13.679" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="59.601" end="1:03.588" itunes:key